OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after man suffers
OL,4,Asuspected gunshot wounds
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men have been arrested after a man
OL,7,Fsuffered injuries consistent with
OL,8,Fgunshot wounds in Swanley.
OL,10,FKent Police was called to Acacia Walk
OL,11,Fat about 20:50 BST on Thursday
OL,12,Ffollowing reports of a serious assault.
OL,14,FOfficers attended with paramedics and
OL,15,Ffound a man in his 20s injured.
OL,17,FHe was taken to a hospital in London
OL,18,Fwhere he remains in a serious but
OL,19,Fstable condition, police said.
